%N A399168 G.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = (1 + 4*x*A(x)^7)^(1/2).
%H A399168 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fuss-Catalan_number">Fuss-Catalan number</a>.
%F A399168 G.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = 1/A(-x*A(x)^12).
%F A399168 a(n) = 4^n * binomial(7*n/2 - 1/2,n)/(5*n+1).
%o A399168 (PARI) apr(n, p, r) = r*binomial(n*p+r, n)/(n*p+r);
%o A399168 a(n) = 4^n*apr(n, 7/2, 1/2);
